/S /H2
/P 201 0 R
/T (The Farm Management System is a custom Lightning application developed on the Salesforce platform. It helps a farm manager keep the records of farms, crops, farmers and buyers in one secure place and view simple summaries of them.)
/E (The Farm Management System is a custom Lightning application developed on the Salesforce platform. It helps a farm manager keep the records of farms, crops, farmers and buyers in one secure place and view simple summaries of them.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 201 0 R
/T (The system uses four custom objects: Farm, Crop, Farmer and Buyer. A Master-Detail relationship connects each farm to its farmer, and a Lookup relationship connects each crop to its farm. A dependent picklist makes the District choices depend on the State, and a formula field calculates the expected yield per acre automatically.)
/E (The system uses four custom objects: Farm, Crop, Farmer and Buyer. A Master-Detail relationship connects each farm to its farmer, and a Lookup relationship connects each crop to its farm. A dependent picklist makes the District choices depend on the State, and a formula field calculates the expected yield per acre automatically.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 201 0 R
/T (Access to data is controlled by the Farm Manager profile and role together with sharing rules for the Crop and Buyer objects. The Farm Management System app brings six navigation items together: Farms, Crops, Farmers, Buyers, Reports and Dashboards. The Farmer With Farms report and dashboard summarise which farms belong to which farmers.)
/E (Access to data is controlled by the Farm Manager profile and role together with sharing rules for the Crop and Buyer objects. The Farm Management System app brings six navigation items together: Farms, Crops, Farmers, Buyers, Reports and Dashboards. The Farmer With Farms report and dashboard summarise which farms belong to which farmers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
