/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 205 0 R
/T (records of a farming business into one unified digital record. It manages four kinds of information: farms, crops, farmers and buyers. Every record is linked to the others, so a user can start from a farmer and reach his farms, or start from a crop and find the farm and the farmer behind it.)
/E (records of a farming business into one unified digital record. It manages four kinds of information: farms, crops, farmers and buyers. Every record is linked to the others, so a user can start from a farmer and reach his farms, or start from a crop and find the farm and the farmer behind it.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 205 0 R
/T (The application was built entirely with the declarative tools of the Salesforce platform. Custom objects, fields, relationships, a dependent picklist, a formula field, a profile, a role, sharing rules, a Lightning app, a report and a dashboard were configured from the Setup menu without writing any program code.)
/E (The application was built entirely with the declarative tools of the Salesforce platform. Custom objects, fields, relationships, a dependent picklist, a formula field, a profile, a role, sharing rules, a Lightning app, a report and a dashboard were configured from the Setup menu without writing any program code.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
