2493 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system uses four custom objects: Farm, Crop, Farmer and Buyer. A Master-Detail relationship connects each farm to its farmer, and a Lookup relationship connects each crop to its farm. A dependent picklist makes the District choices depend on the State, and a formula field calculates the expected yield per acre automatically.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1874 0 R
/Prev 2180 0 R
/Next 2666 0 R
>>
endobj
2494 0 obj
<<
/Title (The whole solution was configured without writing code, using Object Manager, App Manager, Report Builder and Dashboard Builder in a Salesforce Developer Edition organisation. The project shows how a cloud platform can replace scattered paper and spreadsheet records with a connected and secure system.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1874 0 R
/Prev 2666 0 R
/Next 2181 0 R
>>
endobj
